Arm Performix: CMake replacement for the mise + go-task build layer.

Unpack from the repository root:

    tar -xzf performix-cmake.tar.gz --strip-components=1 -C /path/to/performix

Files and their destinations, relative to the repository root:

    CMakeLists.txt
    cmake/PerformixGo.cmake
    cmake/PerformixBundle.cmake
    cmake/PerformixProto.cmake
    cmake/scripts/performix_archive.cmake
    core/CMakeLists.txt
    core/apap-cli/CMakeLists.txt
    core/apap-cli/tools-builtin/CMakeLists.txt
    core/atperf-agent/CMakeLists.txt
    docs/cmake-build.md

Nothing in the existing tree is modified or removed. The Taskfiles, mise.toml
and bootstrap still work; this is a parallel route.

Build:

    cmake -S . -B build
    cmake --build build -j"$(nproc)"

See docs/cmake-build.md for options, targets and known gaps.
